10.3 Model Interchange Projects
A project interchange file is contains a single project serialized as a set of model interchange files, archived using
the ZIP format [ZIP]. The archive shall contain a model interchange file for each of the root namespaces in the
project, each formatted in one of the formats listed in 10.2 . In addition, the archive shall contain, at its top level,
